# Omnivorous Flytrap, "Delirium - Whenever this creature enters or attacks, if there are four or more card types among cards in your
# graveyard, distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two target creatures. Then if there are six or more card types ..., double the
# number of +1/+1 counters on those creatures."
# Turn 1: Faithless Looting discards Ornithopter and Lightning Bolt and goes to the graveyard: sorcery, instant, artifact, creature =
# four types. The Flytrap enters, the trigger puts both counters on itself (a 4/6) and, with fewer than six types, no doubling.
# Turn 3: a second Looting discards Plains and Fastbond: land and enchantment make six. The Flytrap attacks, two more counters
# make four, and they double to eight: a 10/12 that deals 10 combat damage (20 -> 10).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Faithless Looting
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Omnivorous Flytrap
Plains
Faithless Looting
Fastbond
Plains
Plains x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter; Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Omnivorous Flytrap.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Divide(Omnivorous Flytrap: 2)
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Omnivorous Flytrap.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Plains; Fastbond)
Bot1.Attack(Omnivorous Flytrap > Bot2)
Bot1.Divide(Omnivorous Flytrap: 2)
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Omnivorous Flytrap.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 8
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Omnivorous Flytrap.Power = 10
Bot1.Battlefield.Omnivorous Flytrap.Toughness = 12
Bot2.Life = 10
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 6
